<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 166 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 166 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 166 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>The Bank allotted 16 million stg outright in bills maturing on or before June 2 and 150 million in repos to June 2.</p>
<p>It has now provided liquidity totalling 521 million stg so far on Monday, in response to a forecast money market shortage of 900 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
